    "horizontalBasis": "Exact-QID whole,13 nested parts,separate southeast campanile and western shop;16 controls/all124 current raw points and earlier whole outline retained.",
    "architecturalHeights": "Whole height21 m and roof:height7 m retained as lower body/eave21 m and ordinary tile ridge28 m. Current parts30 m control the three front gable peaks;29 m parts control three broad transverse roofs and long choir/apse roof;34/35 m inset parts control the raised central roof monitors. Their roof-wall split is estimated: transverse eaves21 m, monitor eaves29 m, apse eaves26 m. Separate mapped campanile45 m is its adopted total above the estimated0.4 m floor. Four tower-stage boundaries10/21/32/45 m, round/pointed aperture partitions and local facade/porch heights are picture estimates, with unverified part datums. Shop8 m height is retained for its mapped western control; extension of the shop row along the south side is picture-led. No independent dimension facts or horizontal rescale."
  },
